      "dc:source": "australian-capital-territory-electoral-amendment-act-1991.pdf, p.2",
      "values:originalText": "Section 16 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by inserting in subsection (2) \"and Schedules 2 and 3\" after\n\"(inclusive)\";\n(b) by omitting paragraph (2) (a);\n(c) by adding at the end of paragraph (6) (b) \"and\";\n(d) by omitting from paragraph (6) (c) \"; and\";\n(e) by omitting paragraph (6) (d).\nVoting at general elections",
      "skos:definition": "Section 16 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by inserting in subsection (2) \"and Schedules 2 and 3\" after\n\"(inclusive)\";\n(b) by omitting paragraph (2) (a);\n(c) by adding at the end of paragraph (6) (b) \"and\";\n(d) by omitting from paragraph (6) (c) \"; and\";\n(e) by omitting paragraph (6) (d).\nVoting at general elections",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-electoral-amendment-act-1991-sec-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-electoral-amendment-act-1991-sec-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "01702f66749d115a46ffd56e79cfffe5e53681b18aefcf0b4779c0528be25e67",
      "skos:note": "Voting at general elections is mandatory."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-capital-territory-electoral-amendment-act-1991#sec-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6 Section 6",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 2,
      "values:originalText": "Section 16 of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by inserting in subsection (2) \"and Schedules 2 and 3\" after\n\"(inclusive)\";\n(b) by omitting paragraph (2) (a);\n(c) by adding at the end of paragraph (6) (b) \"and\";\n(d) by omitting from paragraph (6) (c) \"; and\";\n(e) by omitting paragraph (6) (d).\nVoting at general elections"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-electoral-amendment-act-1991-sec-6-norm",
