    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-electoral-amendment-act-1991-sec-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "7 Section 7",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-capital-territory-electoral-amendment-act-1991#sec-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-capital-territory-electoral-amendment-act-1991.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-capital-territory-electoral-amendment-act-1991.pdf, p.2",
      "values:originalText": "Section 18 of the Principal Act is amended by adding at the end\nthe following subsections:\n\"(2) Paragraph (l)(a) does not prevent the making of special\nprovisions exempting certain persons who are in Antarctica or overseas\nfrom the compulsory voting requirement.\nNote: See section 245 of the Electoral Act.\n\"(3) Paragraph (l)(b) does not prevent the making of special\nprovisions for persons who are so sight impaired or physically\nincapaciated or illerate that they cannot vote without assistance.\nNote: See section 234 of the Electoral Act.' .\nCounting votes: transfer of preferences of provisionally unsuccessful\ncandidates etc.",
      "skos:definition": "Section 18 of the Principal Act is amended by adding at the end\nthe following subsections:\n\"(2) Paragraph (l)(a) does not prevent the making of special\nprovisions exempting certain persons who are in Antarctica or overseas\nfrom the compulsory voting requirement.\nNote: See section 245 of the Electoral Act.\n\"(3) Paragraph (l)(b) does not prevent the making of special\nprovisions for persons who are so sight impaired or physically\nincapaciated or illerate that they cannot vote without assistance.\nNote: See section 234 of the Electoral Act.' .\nCounting votes: transfer of preferences of provisionally unsuccessful\ncandidates etc.",
      "cml:asserts": [
