      "dc:source": "australian-capital-territory-electoral-amendment-act-1991.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "The Principal Act is amended by adding at the end the Schedules\nset out in Schedules 5 and 6 of this Act.\nTransitional—certain registered parties to provide membership list",
      "skos:definition": "The Principal Act is amended by adding at the end the Schedules\nset out in Schedules 5 and 6 of this Act.\nTransitional—certain registered parties to provide membership list",
      "cml:asserts": [
